  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Fund to Fight AIDS, Tuberculosis and Malaria Core Contributions 2020-21 to 2022-23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding contributions to the Global Fund to Fight AIDS TB and Malaria for financial years 2020-21 to 2022-23. This investment contributes to Australia&apos;s pledge of $242 million to the 6th replenishment of the Global Fund. The total value of this investment is $217.8 million and covers Australia&apos;s core funding contribution. This funding is pooled with other donor core contributions. Its utilisation is overseen by the Global Fund Board on which Australia is represented.</narrative>
  </description>
